        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no better way to spend a beautiful autumn day than to crank up the old leaf blower and give a lawn the care it deserves. Or a winter day. Or a spring day. Or a stormy night.  Leaf Blower Something lets you experience the sheer joy of blasting leaves across a yard any time, any season, any weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as seasoned pro Juan or weekend warrior Ron. Blow the leaves into the designated area before time runs out. Get paid based on how many leaves make it into the pile — then use your earnings to upgrade your blower and keep it fueled up. Do poorly and you'll find yourself out of a job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't get too comfortable. Each round, the challenge ramps up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍂 The leaf spawn area grows — and the target pile shrinks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐿️ Animals show up and they are NOT here to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌬️ Wind gusts get more frequent and more obnoxious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚧 Obstacles show up more frequently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Random encounters keep things unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your leaf blower can be upgraded up to Level 5 for maximum power and fuel efficiency — but neglect it and it'll degrade on you mid-job. Keep it maintained, or suffer the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rounds can be set to 15, 30, 45, or 60 seconds.  Each round length has its own settings and feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not in the mood for chaos? Jump into the relaxed mode — no animals, no encounters, just you, your blower, and a yard full of leaves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No inventory management. No perk cards. No 40-hour tutorial. Just pick up and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Juan says, &quot;Blowing es la vida.&quot; Exactamente, Juan. Exactamente.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Steam Achievements | 🎮 Xbox Controller Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no better way to spend a beautiful autumn day than to crank up the old leaf blower and give a lawn the care it deserves. Or a winter day. Or a spring day. Or a stormy night.  Leaf Blower Something lets you experience the sheer joy of blasting leaves across a yard any time, any season, any weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as seasoned pro Juan or weekend warrior Ron. Blow the leaves into the designated area before time runs out. Get paid based on how many leaves make it into the pile — then use your earnings to upgrade your blower and keep it fueled up. Do poorly and you'll find yourself out of a job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't get too comfortable. Each round, the challenge ramps up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍂 The leaf spawn area grows — and the target pile shrinks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐿️ Animals show up and they are NOT here to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌬️ Wind gusts get more frequent and more obnoxious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚧 Obstacles show up more frequently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Random encounters keep things unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your leaf blower can be upgraded up to Level 5 for maximum power and fuel efficiency — but neglect it and it'll degrade on you mid-job. Keep it maintained, or suffer the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rounds can be set to 15, 30, 45, or 60 seconds.  Each round length has its own settings and feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not in the mood for chaos? Jump into the relaxed mode — no animals, no encounters, just you, your blower, and a yard full of leaves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No inventory management. No perk cards. No 40-hour tutorial. Just pick up and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Juan says, &quot;Blowing es la vida.&quot; Exactamente, Juan. Exactamente.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Steam Achievements | 🎮 Xbox Controller Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "The world's most relaxing lawn job — until the animals and the hearse show up. A fun, no-fuss leaf blowing game you can pick up and play in minutes.",
